\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Discussion}
\title{Which half contains the reflected link?}
\date{2026-11-26}

\p{Under the [site reflection](fdip-007M), an edge lying
in the interior of a closed time half moves into the other
half. A spatial edge at a fixed time stays on the common
boundary. After also negating the spatial coordinates,
which link variables can a function on the reflected
configuration read? The answer determines the domain on
which two reflected integrals can be compared.}
